    {
      "excerpt": null,
      "id": "evidence:openalex:fce1197a0f151f090ac044fe",
      "kind": "observed",
      "raw_sha256": "2f5a3588167de5a29928dc8a3854f1c75f3b545711cd92e79d7e6436bd5b1454",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:30:46.331428Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:1ea454df0cb82a0bcdd429d7208abdd5b5073513eefbd917fc38e13365134220#results[48]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4401024068",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Abductive explanations take a central place in eXplainable Artificial Intelligence (XAI) by clarifying with few features the way data instances are classified.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:6b877c9d915f719a7a2feefb6e4199d0f13576b035750987908e589189c7b8e5",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "a1a771414272a4375c5dd2b0fd277b4997bed6609f6ccbd74be9bfc852fbdf61",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:30:20.084404Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:3ac5b2a796eed9ed50a97078572c1131af544b4283278ee07563798fcc9b79a2#results[11];abstract[0:159]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4285601249",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "We explain how those compilers can be tweaked so as to output certifiable Decision-DNNF circuits, which are mainly standard Decision-DNNF circuits decorated by annotations serving as certificates.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:90d69497ed74a16ebb292a1a735b7545f3d43cce9aa4790e0d6babefc1fa76e0",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "58eafa5f191d27d2bd28132da1da868c601ac65c00bfe5a79c75ffc390ce756f",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:24:47.466796Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:df6939feb999cc877926d46faf42a93a6cb2416d6ffdc500e31020caa07e1d89#results[33];abstract[410:606]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W3174643737",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "It is required to reduce the uncertainty in data fusion and implement the trusted multi-view deep learning.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:91b6f070cb4d08fc1e14e184fff30e3473b9a3deb5b0f1ca5e3282555fa730be",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "3a321bc169da7801776b8591ee4ce5462bd78770b82bed5435c044bd9cb6c074",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:26:05.876432Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:6dbfd0527ef2851a7f71e7f7e0d3e76e74f15237f09b3942f519163e617f70ea#results[5];abstract[299:406]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4283800180",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "An important issue in ML consists in developing approaches exploiting background knowledge T for improving the accuracy and the robustness of learned classifiers C.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:bfb9e42a364aacc5c863946942246701e3bc0d202e6fd46a885085ec3b41a67e",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "736dc2b0c0cb12e544eefba3710a94c05e5036ece3acaeea55adc71dbe116482",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:29:48.554395Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:74a5f413f9215f956789655e02a249f8507493635fae6c98e381256b4e7046a5#results[36];abstract[0:164]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W3190698321",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "This paper is about editing Boolean classifiers, i.e., determining how a Boolean classifier should be modified when new pieces of evidence must be incorporated.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:c31f0280a94b6e342f488db0bbfff7599138b0280e2ea8c8df3f47b18edde7ad",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "a9129c34608fe5dcea87cff49a5617efacec425c5adfba848adf56de6ac5765f",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:26:49.031638Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:f80c85db055bf4eb624f70994a68fae67b8224e5cc8587cd34d87003c26278eb#results[45];abstract[0:160]",
